{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"几何量子化"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"几何量子化"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://math.ucr.edu/home/baez/quantization.html\" title=\"John Baez 的介绍 [https://math.ucr.edu/home/baez/quantization.html]\">John Baez 的介绍</a></span></p>\n<p>由"},{"Local":{"url":"辛流形","text":"辛流形"}},{"Plain":" $(M,\\omega)$ 开始, 先作预量子化, 即选取 "},{"Local":{"url":"Hermite线丛","text":"Hermite 向量丛"}},{"Plain":" $L$, 带有 $U(1)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"联络","text":"联络"}},{"Plain":" $\\nabla$, 使得其曲率等于 $i\\omega$. 这要求 $\\omega / 2\\pi$ 属于整数上同调类.</p>\n"}]}}